<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>hell of a good time</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Haiden Henderson</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">hell of a good time</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7132EFlbWFNX4mLDY23OR5</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.628" end="00:09.203">She's the devil</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.203" end="00:11.057">She's sharpening her nails</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.057" end="00:14.820">And she's hiding little horns in her hair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.820" end="00:16.495">Candy coated</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.495" end="00:18.441">Her lips are full of sugar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.441" end="00:20.142">She'll kiss u then she'll kill u</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.142" end="00:22.645">Beware</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.645" end="00:24.503">She's calling me at 3:00AM</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.503" end="00:26.392">Suddenly i'm out of bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.392" end="00:28.768">I'm driving as far as i can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.768" end="00:30.268">She's pushing me over the</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.053" end="00:31.553">Over the edge</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.125" end="00:32.625">I am possessed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.000" end="00:33.760">I've got a play date with death</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.760" end="00:36.945">I'd go to the hell and back to get her back again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.945" end="00:40.197">If she wants a savior i could be the one to save her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.197" end="00:44.348">Uh(uh) Uh(uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.348" end="00:47.797">If she wants a lover i could be the one to love her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.797" end="00:52.196">Uh(uh) Uh(uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.196" end="00:55.394">She gets her way cause she's beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.394" end="00:57.290">Crazy,delusional</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.290" end="00:59.217">Dances at a funeral!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.217" end="01:02.504">If she wants a savior i could be the one to save her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.504" end="01:05.512">Uh(uh) Uh(uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.512" end="01:07.012">SHE'S THE HELL OF A GOOD TIME!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.999" end="01:14.999" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(LALALALALALALALALALALA)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.953" end="01:19.453">I'd be lucky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.241" end="01:21.265">To be the gum she scrapes off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.265" end="01:24.944">The bottom of her Jimmy Choos</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.944" end="01:26.767">Skin like satin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.767" end="01:28.445">I'm wrapped around her finger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.445" end="01:32.812">For her i'm always in the mood</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.812" end="01:34.636">She's calling me at 3:00 AM</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.636" end="01:36.568">Suddenly i'm out of bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.568" end="01:39.045">I'm driving  as fast as i can</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.045" end="01:40.545">She's pushing me over the</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.247" end="01:41.747">Over the edge</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.184" end="01:42.684">I am possessed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.112" end="01:43.919">I've got a play date with death</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.919" end="01:47.028">I'd go to the hell and back to get her back again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.028" end="01:50.528">If she wants a savior i could be the one to save her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.528" end="01:54.511">Uh(uh) Uh(uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.511" end="01:58.011">If she wants a lover i could be the one to love her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.011" end="02:02.381">Uh(uh) Uh(uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.381" end="02:05.598">She gets her way cause she's beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.598" end="02:07.419">Crazy,delusional</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.419" end="02:09.303">Dances at a funeral!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.303" end="02:12.463">If she wants a savior i could be the one to save her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.463" end="02:15.714">Uh(uh) Uh(uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.714" end="02:17.214">SHE'S THE HELL OF A GOOD TIME!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.185" end="02:22.890" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(LALALALALALALALALALALA)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.890" end="02:24.574">SHE'S THE HELL OF A GOOD TIME!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.574" end="02:31.647" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(LALALALALALALALALALALA)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.647" end="02:35.031">If she wants a savior i could be the one to save her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.031" end="02:37.753">Uh(uh) Uh(uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.753" end="02:41.753">SHE'S THE HELL OF A GOOD TIME!</p></div></body></tt>